{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reclaim the soul of a fallen kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Queen Soul is a third-person action RPG set in a war-torn, visually stunning world. Step into the role of a nameless warrior as you shape your identity, raise a stronghold, and battle through hostile lands to uncover the truth behind the Queen\u2019s disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Core Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Creation \u2013 Customize your appearance and build your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade Your Castle \u2013 Rebuild and expand your stronghold as a base of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-Time Action Combat \u2013 Engage in fast-paced battles with fluid movement and realistic animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A World in Ruin \u2013 Explore detailed environments crafted with realism and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle brings you closer to the heart of a mystery. The Queen\u2019s soul still lingers\u2014but so do the forces that destroyed her.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929810?t=1754707003","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929810/e6efd9e4eb6dee9669207c454d8c5a2dfe475ace/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754707003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929810/971b6a5278c7a59999739153c4a9111e8fe32cf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754707003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929810/971b6a5278c7a59999739153c4a9111e8fe32cf1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754707003","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":2